# RiteMark Patch: ritemark-print-to-pdf
#
# Purpose: Save as PDF: a main-process print of a page in the temporary folder to a PDF beside it (_ritemark.printHtmlToPdf), offline, in a hidden sandboxed window
#
# Why: Sprint 170 (#881): Decks' Save as PDF prints the published page with Chromium (fonts embedded, links live); no extension API prints silently (research/print-path.md)
